<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span><span id="A1.T5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hospital-level partition statistics.</span> The training split is partitioned into five hospital-local databases with comparable disease coverage and HPO-term density.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>HPO-Based Local Retrieval</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Both query and database cases are represented as HPO phenotype-code sets, such as <math id="A2.p1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\{\texttt{HP:0000480},\texttt{HP:0000612},\ldots\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">HP:0000480</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">HP:0000612</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\texttt{HP:0000480},\texttt{HP:0000612},\ldots\}</annotation></semantics></math>. For prompting, each HPO code is deterministically rendered to its canonical term name using the ontology mapping, for example <math id="A2.p1.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\texttt{HP:0000480}\mapsto" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">HP:0000480</mtext><mo stretchy="false">↦</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{HP:0000480}\mapsto</annotation></semantics></math> “Retinal coloboma.” The query contains no free-text clinical narrative.</p>
</div>
<section id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Phenotype embedding.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We encode each phenotype set as an information-content-weighted average of HPO-term embeddings. Each HPO term <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> has a precomputed sentence embedding <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v(t)</annotation></semantics></math> and an information-content weight <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{IC}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>IC</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{IC}(t)</annotation></semantics></math>, where rarer terms receive larger weights. For a phenotype set <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math>, the embedding is</p>
<table id="A2.E8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.E8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e_{Q}=\frac{\sum_{t\in Q}\mathrm{IC}(t)v(t)}{\sum_{t\in Q}\mathrm{IC}(t)}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mrow><mi>IC</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>IC</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e_{Q}=\frac{\sum_{t\in Q}\mathrm{IC}(t)v(t)}{\sum_{t\in Q}\mathrm{IC}(t)}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(8)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Database-case embeddings are computed in the same way.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Similarity and local retrieval.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Retrieval ranks cases by cosine similarity between the query embedding and each candidate case embedding. For hospital <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, retrieval is performed only within its private database <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>. The default setting retrieves one case per hospital, so an <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>-hospital diagnosis instance uses <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> retrieved cases in total. Retrieved cases enter only the local prompt of the hospital that stores them. In <span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">MedLatentDx</span>, retrieved cases are consumed locally and only the compact latent block is transmitted. Retrieved case text crosses hospital boundaries only in text-sharing baselines such as <span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Distributed RAG</span>, <span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Global RAG</span>, and <span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">TextMAS</span>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> HPO-based local retrieval at hospital <math id="alg1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
              
              
            query HPO set <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math>, local database <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, term embeddings <math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math>, IC weights <math id="alg1.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{IC}(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>IC</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{IC}(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math>, top-<math id="alg1.l1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
              
              
            <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e_{Q}\leftarrow\dfrac{\sum_{t\in Q}\mathrm{IC}(t)v(t)}{\sum_{t\in Q}\mathrm{IC}(t)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mrow><mi>IC</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>IC</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e_{Q}\leftarrow\dfrac{\sum_{t\in Q}\mathrm{IC}(t)v(t)}{\sum_{t\in Q}\mathrm{IC}(t)}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each case <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c\in\mathcal{D}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c\in\mathcal{D}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e_{c}\leftarrow\dfrac{\sum_{t\in c}\mathrm{IC}(t)v(t)}{\sum_{t\in c}\mathrm{IC}(t)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mrow><mi>IC</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>IC</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e_{c}\leftarrow\dfrac{\sum_{t\in c}\mathrm{IC}(t)v(t)}{\sum_{t\in c}\mathrm{IC}(t)}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{c}\leftarrow\dfrac{\langle e_{Q},e_{c}\rangle}{\lVert e_{Q}\rVert\,\lVert e_{c}\rVert}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">∥</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">∥</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">∥</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">∥</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{c}\leftarrow\dfrac{\langle e_{Q},e_{c}\rangle}{\lVert e_{Q}\rVert\,\lVert e_{c}\rVert}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\operatorname{top\text{-}k}_{c\in\mathcal{D}_{i}}s_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>top</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\operatorname{top\text{-}k}_{c\in\mathcal{D}_{i}}s_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Baselines and Prompt Templates</h2>

<section id="A3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.1 </span>Baseline access patterns</h3>

<div id="A3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A3.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ C.1 Baseline access patterns ‣ Appendix C Baselines and Prompt Templates ‣ MedLatentDx: Latent Multi-Agent Communication for Cross-Hospital Rare-Disease Diagnosis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> summarizes the information access pattern of each method. The baselines differ in whether they use evidence from other hospitals, whether retrieved clinical text crosses hospital boundaries, and whether they transmit internal model states or compact latent blocks. <span id="A3.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">MedLatentDx</span> and the latent baselines aggregate cross-hospital evidence without transmitting retrieved clinical text.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T6" class="ltx_table">
<div id="A3.T6.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:139pt;vertical-align:-66.6pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(22.1pt,-8.9pt) scale(1.14671002101312,1.14671002101312) ;">
<table id="A3.T6.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A3.T6.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A3.T6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Method</th>
<th id="A3.T6.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Cross-hospital</th>
<th id="A3.T6.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Text shared</th>
<th id="A3.T6.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Latent shared</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A3.T6.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T6.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t"><span id="A3.T6.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Zero-shot</span></td>
<td id="A3.T6.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A3.T6.2.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">✗</span></td>
<td id="A3.T6.2.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A3.T6.2.1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">✗</span></td>
<td id="A3.T6.2.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A3.T6.2.1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">✗</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T6.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T6.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="A3.T6.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Single RAG</span></td>
<td id="A3.T6.2.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A3.T6.2.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">✗</span></td>
<td id="A3.T6.2.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A3.T6.2.1.3.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">✗</span></td>
