<figure id="A9.T19" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 19: </span><span id="A9.T19.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Paired bootstrap confidence intervals.</span> We report the difference between <span id="A9.T19.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">MedLatentDx</span> and the strongest non-<span id="A9.T19.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">MedLatentDx</span> baseline for each host and metric. Intervals are 95% paired bootstrap confidence intervals over <math id="A9.T19.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1{,}000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1,000</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1{,}000</annotation></semantics></math> resamples of the <math id="A9.T19.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="401" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>401</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">401</annotation></semantics></math> test cases. A positive interval indicates that <span id="A9.T19.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">MedLatentDx</span> is significantly better under the bootstrap test.</figcaption>
